{{- define "wake_audit_replan" -}}
Audit findings classified as REPLAN_REQUIRED have been submitted.
The auditor has identified issues that require changes to the current plan.

YOUR TASK:
1. Read the blackboard to see all REPLAN_REQUIRED audit findings (look for findings where resolved is false and linked_task_id is empty)
2. For each unresolved finding, evaluate the evidence and recommended action
3. Create new tasks OR supersede existing tasks as needed to address the findings
4. CRITICAL: When creating a remediation task, you MUST pass the origin_finding_id parameter set to the finding's ID. This links the task to the finding and prevents this wake trigger from firing again for addressed findings.
5. Each new task must meet all self-validation gates (spec ref, acceptance criteria, verify commands)
6. After creating remediation tasks, update sprint metrics

IMPORTANT: If you do NOT pass origin_finding_id when creating tasks, the findings will remain unresolved and this wake trigger will fire again in an infinite loop.

Do NOT create a sprint checkpoint. There is still work to do.
{{- end -}}
